# What `make build` uploads to Cloud Build: only what the Dockerfile needs.
# Everything else (.env, Terraform state and vars, .venv, reports, docs) stays on your machine.
*
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!cloudbuild.yaml
!requirements.txt
!weekendwise/
!weekendwise/**
!data/
data/*
!data/seed/
!data/seed/**
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
.DS_Store
